# Citing Moondream

If you use Moondream in your research, please cite the model:

```bibtex
@misc {vik_2024,
  author = { {Vikhyat Korrapati} },
  title = { moondream2 (Revision 92d3d73) },
  year = 2024,
  url = { https://moondream.ai/ },
  doi = { 10.57967/hf/3219 },
  publisher = { Hugging Face }
}
```

See the [Moondream model card](https://huggingface.co/vikhyatk/moondream2) for the latest model revisions and metadata.
